sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Employee
  participant A as API + Runtime
  participant G as Supervisor graph
  participant M as Model (guarded)
  participant X as Executor · Gateway · Policy
  participant L as Audit log
  participant T as Tool (local / MCP)
  U->>A: POST message (identity header, Idempotency-Key, SSE)
  A->>A: authenticate · idempotency begin · http span
  A->>G: run turn (checkpointed thread)
  G->>M: route → RoutingPlan
  M-->>G: service_desk: "create a ticket"
  G->>M: specialist call (its tools only)
  M-->>G: create_ticket(args)
  G->>X: execute(tool, args, UserContext)
  X->>X: schema check · policy (ALLOW)
  X->>L: DECISION event (before acting)
  X->>T: run (idempotency key)
  T-->>X: INC-1008
  X->>L: OUTCOME event
  X-->>G: tool result
  G->>M: specialist call
  M-->>G: final answer
  G-->>A: AgentRun (trajectory, trace_id)
  A-->>U: SSE activity… then result
